  "unknowns": [
    "Beep duration, gap and loop length in ms are not stated.",
    "The order and number of tones in the loop are given only by the chart; each tone repeats 4 times in the chart notation.",
    "Whether the throttle must stay at max between tones is not stated beyond 'if left at max beyond 5 s the sequence starts'.",
    "Chart tone glyphs are text approximations; pitch information is not available.",
    "Time the tone loop starts: 'beyond 5 s' only; the loop's first tone start time is not stated.",
    "For brake and motor rotation (one tone each) the manual does not say how to select the opposite of the stored value.",
    "Default of soft acceleration is stated as 'Medium', a name that does not appear in the three-value list."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Readytosky_30A_ESC.pdf is the same manual text as Mystery_ESC.pdf with model A-OEM-30A; Mystery_ESC.pdf names ZTW as maker (brand set to Mystery).",
    "Mystery_ESC.pdf: the tone table gives Medium cutoff as 3.0 V/60 %; the text gives Ni cutoffs 50/65/65 % and the restore list gives 3.0 V/65 %. Same text in Readytosky_30A_ESC.pdf.",
    "Same tone chart as Hitec Energy Sport (hitec-energy-sport); the Hitec manual has a different entry text.",
    "INDEX.csv says this scheme matches ZTW Gecko; it does not (Gecko uses short/long counts)."
  ],
